    "body": "This PR adds functional test coverage for cluster-limit handling during reorgs.\r\n\r\nTransactions resurrected from disconnected blocks are added before their existing mempool children are linked in the transaction graph. Once those dependencies are restored, oversized clusters must be trimmed back within their configured count and size limits.",
